     A* Printer file keyword coverage. Every keyword the grammar
     A* recognizes appears at least once in the functions area.
     A* Member: PRTKWD
     A* Compilable: no - an exhaustive keyword list, not a working file.
     A* Source: IBM i 7.5 DDS for printer files, keyword entries.
     A* Retrieved: 2026-07-25
     A*
     A* File-level keywords
00010A                                      INDARA
00020A                                      REF(REFLIB/MLGREFP)
00030A                                      ALIAS
00040A                                      CHRID(*JOBCCSID)
00050A                                      CPI(15)
00060A                                      LPI(8)
00070A                                      DRAWER(2)
00080A                                      DUPLEX(*YES)
00090A                                      OUTBIN(2)
00100A                                      PAGRTT(90)
00110A                                      PRTQLTY(*DRAFT)
00120A                                      FONT(011)
00130A                                      FONTNAME('Courier')
00140A                                      CDEFNT(QFNTCPL/C0S0CR10)
00150A                                      FNTCHRSET(QFNTCPL/C0S0CR10 +
     A                                        QFNTCPL/T1V10037)
00160A                                      DFNCHR(X'0E0E0E0E0E0E0E0E0E0E0E0E')
00170A                                      FLTPCN(*SINGLE)
00180A                                      FLTFIXDEC
00190A                                      CVTDTA
00200A                                      BLKFOLD
00210A                                      ZFOLD
00220A                                      TRNSPY
00230A                                      UNISCRIPT(*YES)
00240A                                      DOCIDXTAG('Chapter' &FLD)
00250A                                      DTASTMCMD('cmd')
     A*
     A* Record-level keywords
00260A          R RECKWDS                   TEXT('Record level')
00270A                                      SKIPA(1) SKIPB(2)
00280A                                      SPACEA(1) SPACEB(2)
00290A                                      ENDPAGE
00300A                                      STRPAGGRP('Group1')
00310A                                      ENDPAGGRP
00320A                                      OVERLAY(QGPL/MYOVL 1.0 2.0)
00330A                                      PAGSEG(QGPL/MYSEG 1.0 2.0)
00340A                                      AFPRSC(QGPL/MYRSC *PAGSEG)
00350A                                      INVMMAP('MAP1')
00360A                                      INVDTAMAP('DMAP1')
00370A                                      STAPLE(*TOPLEFT)
00380A                                      INDTXT(01 'Detail line printed')
     A*
     A* Field-level keywords
00390A          R FLDKWDS
00400A            AMOUNT         9S 2O     2EDTCDE(Y)
00410A            TOTAL          9S 2O    +2EDTWRD('  $0.  ')
00420A            NETPAY         9S 2O    +2DLTEDT(3)
00430A            REFFLDX   R             +2REFFLD(CUSTNO REFLIB/MLGREFP)
00440A            STATE          2A  O    +2BARCODE(CODE3OF9 4 *NOHRI *AST)
00450A            BIGTEXT       10A  O    +2CHRSIZ(2 2)
00460A            BLUENAME      10A  O    +2COLOR(BLU)
00470A            DFTFLD        10A  O    +2DFT('default')
00480A            MSGFLD        20A  O    +2MSGCON(20 MSG0001 QGPL/MYMSGF)
00490A            POSFLD         5A  O      POSITION(3 10)
00500A            RELFLD         5A  O      RELPOS(2 4)
00510A            LINEFLD        5A  O    +2LINE(1 1 2 2)
00520A            BOXFLD         5A  O    +2BOX(1 1 5 20)
00530A            GDFFLD         5A  O    +2GDF(QGPL/MYGDF 1.0 2.0)
00540A            ROTATED        5A  O    +2TXTRTT(90)
00550A                                    +2UNDERLINE HIGHLIGHT
00560A                                    +2FORCE
     A*
     A* Date and time keywords with their formatting options
00570A          R DATETIME
00580A                                     2DATE(*JOB) DATFMT(*ISO) DATSEP('/')
00590A                                    +2TIME TIMFMT(*HMS) TIMSEP(':')
00600A                                    +2PAGNBR EDTCDE(Z)
     A* A keyword must not match inside a longer name: MYGDF holds GDF,
     A* EQFREF holds REF, and MYLINE holds LINE.
09000A                                      GDF(QGPL/MYGDF 1.0 2.0)
09010A                                      REF(*LIBL/EQFREF)
09020A                                      OVERLAY(QGPL/MYLINE 1.0 2.0)
     A* Several keywords may appear on one line.
09030A                                      SKIPB(2) SPACEA(1) FORCE
